  "analysis_en": [
    "By 08:50 on Oct 23, SJC and PNJ trimmed bar prices another 0.3 million to 139.0–142.0 million VND per tael (early morning they still held 139.3–142.3, per CafeF); SJC rings fell harder to 136.0–140.0 million, down 1.4 million on the bid and 0.9 million on the ask from yesterday.",
